PDIA0","body":"Hello there, \nWelcomer back. I understand that you want to change the email address on your account.\n\nSInce  you have access to your email address. For security reasons, we always first encourage our players to change the email themselves to avoid any mistakes and to make suare that it is the account owner who is sending the request, as you mentioned that someone else accessed the account.\nYou can update the mail address on your Ubisoft account by following the steps in this article: https://www.ubisoft.com/help/?article=000062085\n\nAs we have attended to this request, we will be marking this case as closed, however if you need help in a different matter, you can create a new case or you can re-open the same ticket and we will assist you accordingly.\n\nThank you in advance for your patience and understanding. \n \nIf you have any questions or other concerns, please feel free to get back to us. \nKind regards,\nUbisoft Support","createdBy":"Ubisoft Agent","createdAt":"2026-07-14T09:35:02","source":"CaseComment"},{"id":"00aRm00000sXjP5IAK","body":"i can acess my acount but i need to change my email as i don't live in hungary but someone from their loged into my account. can you please help my change my email and then the ticket can be closed?","createdBy":"Technical API","createdAt":"2026-07-14T09:26:48","source":"CaseComment"},{"id":"00aRm00000sXkplIAC","body":"Hello Gamer,\n\nThank you for reaching out regarding the issue with your Ubisoft account email. \n\nI understand the frustration that comes with not being able to access your account or utilize certain features.\n\nSince the email address on your account is invalid and you cannot log in, we can assist you in changing it.\n\nThankyou for confirming that you are unable to change the email address on the account.\n\nTo investigate further we request you to provide us the image of error  that you are experiencing while you try to change the email on the account.\n\nIf you have any further questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out.\n\nKind regards,\nUbisoft support","createdBy":"Ubisoft Agent","createdAt":"2026-07-14T09:18:42","source":"CaseComment"},{"id":"00aRm00000sXUUwIAO","body":"helo i folowed the article but it didnt work. it would jast be easier for you to change it and then my ticket can be closed.","createdBy":"Technical API","createdAt":"2026-07-14T09:09:41","source":"CaseComment"},{"id":"00aRm00000sXK5rIAG","body":"Hello there! \n \nThank you for verifying your Ubisoft account.\n \nSince you were able to verify your account, you can change your email on your end by following the article below: \nhttps://www.ubisoft.com/help/article/000062085 \n\nAlso, I advise you to change your password - https://www.ubisoft.com/help/article/000066967 \n  \nWe look forward to your reply. If you have any follow-up questions on this topic or should you have any other questions or concerns, you can reach us via this case anytime through the Help Portal. \n \nBest Regards, \nUbisoft Support","createdBy":"Ubisoft Agent","createdAt":"2026-07-14T09:04:58","source":"CaseComment"},{"id":"00aRm00000sWxVjIAK","body":"hi i looked at my account today and notice suspicious logins that were not made by me. can you please help me change my email? also i opened the verify email you sent me.","createdBy":"Technical API","createdAt":"2026-07-14T09:00:47","source":"CaseComment"},{"id":"00aRm00000sX9AMIA0","body":"Hello Player,\n\nI hope you are doing well today.\n\nThank you for reaching out to Ubisoft Support. I understand that you want to recover access to your Ubisoft account since you submitted the case via account recovery form. Is that correct?\n\nBefore we proceed further, we are required to send a verification link to the email address currently linked to the Ubisoft account even if you have confirmed that you do not have access to it. We need to verify that you are the owner of the relevant Ubisoft account since we cannot share information or make changes to the account without verification. To do so, an email has been sent to your email address with a verification link. Please click the link to complete verification. The link is valid for 72 hours. If you cannot locate the email in your inbox, please be sure to check your spam folder.\n\nLooking forward to your response. If you have any further concerns or questions, please feel free to reach out to us anytime.\n\nSincerely,\nUbisoft Support","createdBy":"Ubisoft Agent","createdAt":"2026-07-14T07:29:47","source":"CaseComment"}],"total":10},7:headers;477:40:4:date,29:Tue, 14 Jul 2026 10:22:58 GMT,]51:12:content-type,31:application/json; charset=utf-8,]25:14:content-length,4:5567,]31:6:server,18:openresty/1.29.2.1,]58:27:access-control-allow-origin,23:https://www.ubisoft.com,]60:16:ubi-forwarded-by,36:useast1-pub-621-gw-09b6c1bb4a2627c03,]61:17:ubi-transactionid,36:e5708904-2848-457a-80a1-0745ffd667af,]49:25:strict-transport-security,16:max-age=63072000,]26:15:x-frame-options,4:DENY,]36:22:x-content-type-options,7:nosniff,]]12:http_version;8:HTTP/2.0,}7:request;3473:4:path;87:/v1/profiles/me/global/cshelp/cases/api/case/26358701/interactions/?offset=0&limit=9999,9:authority;26:public-ubiservices.ubi.com,6:scheme;5:https,6:method;3:GET,4:port;3:443#4:host;26:public-ubiservices.ubi.com;13:timestamp_end;17:1784024576.381956^15:timestamp_start;18:1784024576.3808718^8:trailers;0:~7:content;0:,7:headers;3102:98:10:user-agent,80:Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:151.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/151.0,]15:6:accept,3:*/*,]37:15:accept-language,14:en-US,en;q=0.9,]46:15:accept-encoding,23:gzip, deflate, br, zstd,]38:7:referer,24:https://www.ubisoft.com/,]35:27:access-control-allow-origin,1:*,]2377:13:authorization,2354:ubi_v1 .gx1eMt1rjr-M7To2lCijGEJvPfS8x3Y4rmJiwLruoKqo4oY_GiDSSFpy0exBRpkReNTcEHIkaYScfY4ptu3zu7Ed_IfDQMKQoQjsOIWUrPwuMZ7l-OKaK6sxWtbSkoSIy8DXQVmRw33_kdoQrFsjtUNb94hLQRLmvgEur43FTEWwblkz3WgG16RsqNXxb93US8S4DaFddsWaOp0Q7BGAVbABosr2Dk8t1EytEB8UGgMYH-sR2MWMJmZPB20